    "## Data Cleaning: Extracting years 2023-2025 from the raw dataset to the dataset_cleaned folder."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "217d5289",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
