    "* **Hydrological Insight:** Because $\\tau_{\\mu,\\mathrm{sta}} > \\tau_{\\mu,\\mathrm{riv}}$, the model reveals that absolute flow volume shifts more significantly due to localized station factors (e.g., local catchment area, specific positioning along the stream, localized topography) than due to the macro-identity of the river basin itself.\n",
